2026-10-30: converted to the Fenolite format by Fenolite 0.7.0.dev0 (fenolite import --to python); the board is rewritten as Python code (design.py, copper.py) with its footprints vendored in lib/; content the Fenolite DSL cannot express yet was left out and is listed in PROVENANCE.json

Upstream: the folder demos/video of the KiCad source repository at commit 97acc80c223d75520c03fc44cab63cd9a3202c42,
https://gitlab.com/kicad/code/kicad/-/tree/97acc80c223d75520c03fc44cab63cd9a3202c42/demos/video

