LICENSE.README of that repository, at that commit, states "Licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0: All the
demo files provided in demos/*"; no licence file of the demo folder says otherwise. LICENSE here is
the file LICENSE.CC-BY-SA-4.0 of the same commit, unchanged. This converted item stays under
CC BY-SA 4.0. No individual author or copyright line is named in the demo's files; the material
is distributed by the KiCad project.

Footprints: the footprints in lib/ come from the board itself (each instance brought back to its
origin by the import); no file of KiCad's official libraries was copied. Footprints derived from
the KiCad libraries follow the design exception of their licence (CC-BY-SA 4.0 with an exception
for designs that use the library material, see https://www.kicad.org/libraries/license/). The
symbols in lib/*.kicad_sym are drawn by Fenolite from the pad numbers of the footprints.

